{"defaultLocale":"en-US","id":"Nub.Nub","installers":[{"architecture":"x64","commands":["nub","nubr","nubx"],"dependencies":[],"id":"x64-zip","nestedInstallerFiles":[{"PortableCommandAlias":"nub","RelativeFilePath":"bin\\nub.exe"},{"PortableCommandAlias":"nubx","RelativeFilePath":"bin\\nubx.exe"},{"PortableCommandAlias":"nubr","RelativeFilePath":"bin\\nubr.exe"}],"nestedInstallerType":"portable","priority":4,"sha256":"53fe2a1719d93e1fa209cd3737cc438690596ecfe1c867135b24f7f133c7a7f8","successCodes":[],"type":"zip","url":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/releases/download/v0.10.0/nub-win32-x64.zip"},{"architecture":"arm64","commands":["nub","nubr","nubx"],"dependencies":[],"id":"arm64-zip","nestedInstallerFiles":[{"PortableCommandAlias":"nub","RelativeFilePath":"bin\\nub.exe"},{"PortableCommandAlias":"nubx","RelativeFilePath":"bin\\nubx.exe"},{"PortableCommandAlias":"nubr","RelativeFilePath":"bin\\nubr.exe"}],"nestedInstallerType":"portable","priority":4,"sha256":"5ce6906c25b113a06d1fdbaa2e69c0a24823f6712a9364c3a6ae46c928ecf86e","successCodes":[],"type":"zip","url":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/releases/download/v0.10.0/nub-win32-arm64.zip"}],"licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","packageLocalizations":{"en-US":{"author":"nub contributors","copyright":"Copyright (c) 2026 nub contributors","copyrightUrl":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","description":"The all-in-one JavaScript toolkit that augments Node.js instead of trying to replace it.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Docs","DocumentUrl":"https://nubjs.com/docs"}],"license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"An all-in-one toolkit for Node.js. One Rust binary to run your files and scripts, install dependencies, and manage Node itself — a Bun-like modern DX on top of the node you already have. There's no new runtime to adopt and no lock-in: every augmentation rides on Node's own public extension surfaces.","moniker":"nub","name":"Nub","packageUrl":"https://nubjs.com/","publisher":"nub contributors","publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/issues","publisherUrl":"https://nubjs.com/","releaseNotes":"Nub 0.10.0 brings dependency build scripts and --filter in line with pnpm 12, writes pnpm lockfiles that pnpm accepts in more layouts, and backfills util.debounce, util.throttle and the JSON.parse options proposal.\nImportant\nFive changes can surface in an existing project:\n- An unapproved dependency build script fails the install with ERR_NUB_IGNORED_BUILDS and exit 1. strictDepBuilds=false restores the warning (#1050)\n- A git dependency with a prepare script builds only when approved, and otherwise fails with ERR_NUB_GIT_DEP_PREPARE_NOT_ALLOWED (#1045)\n- --filter ./packages selects only a project whose directory is packages. Use ./packages/* or ./packages/** for the projects under it (#1056)\n- A --filter that selects no project exits 0, and --fail-if-no-match exits 1 (#1064)\n- nub rebuild <pkg> no longer approves the package it names (#1050)\nDependency build scripts\nAn install that meets a build script nobody has approved now fails, as under pnpm 12. It fails last, once node_modules is linked and the approved builds and the project's own scripts have run. Global installs and nubx stay non-strict.\n$ nub install\ndependencies:\n+ core-js@3.40.0\nERR_NUB_IGNORED_BUILDS\n  × Ignored build scripts: core-js@3.40.0\n  help: Run `nub approve-builds` to pick which dependencies may run their\n        build scripts, or set `strictDepBuilds=false` to install without them.\n────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────\nArea                    │What changed                                                                                                                                                                     │Link\n────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────\nDenials                 │nub approve-builds '!pkg' and --allow-build='!pkg' record a denial, and --allow-build=pkg refuses a package the project denies. An explicit false outranks                       │#1050\n                        │dangerouslyAllowAllBuilds.                                                                                                                                                       │\n────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────\nSettings                │dangerouslyAllowAllBuilds and strictDepBuilds are read from .npmrc, the environment and, in a pnpm project, pnpm-workspace.yaml.                                                 │#1050\n────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────\nnub rebuild             │Reports unapproved packages instead of passing over them. A filtered rebuild works in a shared-lockfile workspace, where it did nothing.                                         │#1050\n────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────\nMember approvals        │nub rebuild, nub ignored-builds and nub approve-builds read the same approvals as nub install, workspace members' included.                                                      │#1050\n────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────\nGit dependency approval │Approved by <name>@git+<repository> or the same key with #<commit>. A bare name, name@version or * does not approve one, and a denial installs it unbuilt.                       │#1045\n────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────\nGit dependency builds   │A hosted dependency such as rimraf@github:isaacs/rimraf#v6.1.3 is now built. It linked with no dist/. The build no longer needs cp, which stock Windows lacks.                   │#1045, fixes #885, #886\n────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────\nProject lifecycle stages│Project scripts follow pnpm 12's stage lists in every project: install adds preprepare and postprepare, remove runs the uninstall stages, and --prod skips the prepare family.   │#1052\n────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────\n\nWorkspace filters\nNub now uses pnpm 12's selector grammar and directory globs on every workspace command, including nub run (#1056).\n- nub run --filter ./packages build\n+ nub run --filter './packages/*' build\n─────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬──────────\nArea                     │What changed                                                                                                                                      │Link\n─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────\nEmpty selection          │Does nothing and exits 0. install, remove and update print Scope: 0 of N workspace projects, and nub ci still cleans node_modules first, as pnpm's│#1064\n                         │does.                                                                                                                                             │\n─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────\nWorkspace root           │run, exec, add and test drop the root from a selection that names no project. Other commands keep it.                                             │#1056\n─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────\nRepeated filtered install│Reports up to date. It reinstalled and reran lifecycle scripts.                                                                                   │#1055\n─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────\nrecursiveInstall         │Read from pnpm-workspace.yaml in a pnpm project.                                                                                                  │#1055\n─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────\nFlags before the verb    │--filter-prod, -C and --dir work there.                                                                                                           │#1064\n─────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼──────────\nnub ls in a member       │Lists that member.                                                                                                                                │#1064\n─────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴──────────\n\nLockfile compatibility\n───────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────\nArea                                   │What changed                                                                                                                                                                    │Link\n───────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────\nPer-project pnpm lockfiles             │Under shared-workspace-lockfile=false, a member's lockfile matches pnpm 10's bytes on the tested workspaces. pnpm's --frozen-lockfile rejected the old form.                    │#1060\n───────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────\nFrozen installs of those trees         │nub install --frozen-lockfile passes on a tree Nub or pnpm 10 wrote, and a plain install keeps a member's locked versions. It failed on the first and re-resolved on the second.│#1062","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/releases/tag/v0.10.0","tags":["javascript-runtime","node-version-manager","nodejs","package-manager","script-runner"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/issues","publisherUrl":"https://nubjs.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-07","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/nubjs/nub/releases/tag/v0.10.0","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"c181387574e3c43d50412bafa5bb24734a67dc26","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/n/Nub/Nub/0.10.0/Nub.Nub.installer.yaml","sha256":"dcfd56e54c4dc050774ff9079491d47a7e7e2910a6e2efdfa2afc6c093a3fe27"},{"path":"manifests/n/Nub/Nub/0.10.0/Nub.Nub.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"da99d8ab666008cb1000bebb0b4fd360177abe238b06f5c937817321c7d13787"},{"path":"manifests/n/Nub/Nub/0.10.0/Nub.Nub.yaml","sha256":"e49cbbd4a08a6f946e1d97a698e8554f459e91f866b304fe13a5c20129ca2228"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.10.0"}